export anchor DarkAnalyticsStyle:
    number: 304
    screen: OpsMonitor
    name: Dark analytics
    idea: Charts lead on a dark slate canvas, a full-width requests chart over error and latency half charts, each series in its own crisp colour, with a service table and stacked lists below.
    base: dark
    palette:
        canvas: #0b1017, the page and style sheet ground
        panel: #121a24, cards and the top bar
        raise: #18222f, the current app tab, the pressed range button and the secondary button
        line: #243243, card borders and table rules
        ink: #e6edf5, text and figures
        muted: #9aa8ba, labels, axes, meta and dashed deploy markers
        requests: #4cc9f0, the requests series and its area, links and the primary button
        errors: #ff7a93, the error series and Firing
        p50: #b19cff, the dashed p50 latency line
        p95: #f2b84b, the p95 latency line, Degraded and Investigating
        healthy: #5ad08e, Healthy and Resolved
        recovered: #7ab8ff, Recovered
        focus: #ffe066, the focus outline
    type:
        One system stack, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue,
        Arial, at 14px and 1.45, with ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas at 13px
        for service names and versions. The page title is 22px at 650,
        figure values 28px at 650 with tabular numbers, card titles 15px at
        650, figure labels 12px caps tracked 0.04em, axes 11px.
    layout:
        A panel coloured top bar holds a gradient square mark and Brightwork
        Ops, the five suite apps as tabs with Ops current and a requests
        coloured underline, an Environment Production pill and a 1h 6h 24h
        7d segmented range with 24h pressed. The page has a title and the
        description line, then four figure cards in a row, each with a caps
        label, a big value, a 96px sparkline and a note, for requests per
        minute, error rate, api p95 latency and the open incident. A wide
        card holds the requests chart with a fading area, four grid lines,
        dashed vertical deploy markers and a ringed peak point labelled
        9,400 at 14.00, with an hour axis and a note. Error rate and latency
        follow as two half cards, the spike marked with a small triangle.
        Below sits a services table beside a stack of three cards, the
        incident card with an amber border and tinted ground, then alerts
        and deploys as ruled lists. Below 980px everything stacks and the
        figures go two by two, at phone width one per row with the table
        in its own sideways scroll.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px card padding and gaps, 24px page padding.
    density: Medium. Four figures, three charts and the lists over about two screens.
    corners: 10px cards, 8px buttons, fields and range control, full round status pills.
    borders: 1px #243243 on every card, inner rules in #1c2735, no borders inside charts.
    shadows: None. Depth comes from the panel step and the tinted incident card.
    icons:
        16px status shapes in tinted pills beside the word. A ringed tick
        for Healthy, a triangle with a bang for Degraded, a circular arrow
        for Recovered, a bolt for Firing, a plain tick for Resolved and a
        magnifier for Investigating.
    focus: A 2px yellow outline offset 2px.
    tone: Neutral analytic labels, such as Requests per minute, Signal and Production overview.
